---

Data and checkpoints are NOT covered by this licence.

* Food-101 (the 20-class training set, the canteen_clean split and the proxy
  canteen split) is distributed for non-commercial research use only:
  Bossard et al., "Food-101 -- Mining Discriminative Components with Random
  Forests", ECCV 2014, https://data.vision.ee.ethz.ch/cvl/datasets_extra/food-101/
* Food-101N (the external-data experiment) follows the same terms:
  Lee et al., "CleanNet", CVPR 2018, https://kuanghuei.github.io/Food-101N/
* The Chinese dishes in the 116-class model come from ChineseFoodNet
  (non-commercial): Chen et al., arXiv:1705.02743.
* Photographs under data/splits/canteen_real, data/splits/mixed_real and
  data/splits/negatives were taken or collected by the author for this
  coursework and are shared for review only.
* The calorie priors follow the Chinese Food Composition Table (6th ed.) and
  public chain-store nutrition pages; they are rough teaching estimates, not
  dietary advice.
